1
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:11,750
I'll plunge this world into darkness!

2
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:18,670
That's as far as you go, Devil Count!

3
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:24,800
Ugh... This lame theme song... It's Justice Man!

4
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,560
That hero's getting in the
way at the good part again!

5
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,840
You can do it! I believe in you, Devil Earl!

6
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,560
Kick Justice Man's butt!

7
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:36,170
Justice Punch!

8
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,260
Dang it! He lost again!

9
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:45,080
When will there be a monster
that can defeat Justice Man?

10
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:46,890
Huh?

11
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,270
Heroes don't lose to anyone?

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,000
But why?

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,210
Justice always prevails?

14
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:55,290
But that's not fair!

15
00:00:55,290 --> 00:00:57,780
Monsters have ambitions, too!

16
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:00,880
Monsters are working hard, too...

17
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:05,160
And yet, they always just die in the end...

18
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:09,040
But I want to support them...
What about my feelings?

19
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,930
Monsters are so much cooler...

20
00:01:12,690 --> 00:01:17,190
That the popular guys win and the
unpopular guys lose is a tragedy.

21
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:22,130
In that case... I won't lose to anyone.

22
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:25,640
I'll become the ultimate monster.

23
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:37,110
What am I doing here?

24
00:01:42,530 --> 00:01:45,760
I don't really remember
what happened last night.

25
00:03:19,810 --> 00:03:23,320
Regarding Director Zeimeet's
assault by a thug last night...

26
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:26,900
We're certain that Garo the
hero hunter was behind it.

27
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:29,790
So that means he's not
only going after heroes.

28
00:03:29,790 --> 00:03:31,410
He's going after the Association itself.

29
00:03:31,410 --> 00:03:34,740
He's strong enough to
defeat Tank-Top Master.

30
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:37,620
Regular guards won't be enough.

31
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:39,770
Let's issue an alert.

32
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,710
Executives should avoid going
outside unnecessarily

33
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:48,430
and, if they must go anywhere,
have Class S heroes accompany them.

34
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,860
Are you sure?

35
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:54,020
The Class S heroes have been rather
busy dealing with monsters lately.

36
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:59,600
But the safety of executives close
to our sponsors is more important.

37
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:02,440
Bodyguard for an executive?

38
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:05,400
I decline. Why?

39
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:09,360
Because I'm in the middle
of a battle right now.

40
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:15,580
I just defeated them, but I'm now heading
to the stage with the secret boss.

41
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,320
Call someone else.

42
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:25,670
Thanks for being my bodyguard
today, Metal Bat.

43
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:26,170
Class S Rank 15
Metal Bat

44
00:04:26,170 --> 00:04:29,130
I came here because I was told that
there was an important mission...

45
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:32,850
Apparently executives from the Hero
Association are also being targeted right now,

46
00:04:33,210 --> 00:04:37,740
but my son insisted on trying
some commoner food today.

47
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:39,770
Wow, look, Papa!

48
00:04:39,770 --> 00:04:41,750
There's even pudding on this thing!

49
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:47,370
I was wondering how vile sushi
must be if it's under 10,000 yen,

50
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:49,940
but it seems this can actually be quite fun.

51
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:52,880
The hell is this? Literally hell?

52
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,780
Hey! Don't put back a plate you ate from!

53
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:57,140
Why?

54
00:04:57,140 --> 00:04:59,470
They need it when they tally up your total.

55
00:04:59,470 --> 00:05:02,500
But returning the plates
is proper etiquette.

56
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:06,410
I just told you not to return the plates!

57
00:05:06,410 --> 00:05:09,310
The color of this urchin is awful.

58
00:05:09,890 --> 00:05:11,180
Don't they have any caviar?

59
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:12,930
What's medium fatty tuna?

60
00:05:12,930 --> 00:05:16,460
You can actually eat part
of a tuna that's not fatty tuna?

61
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:18,060
Stop putting it back!

62
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:21,190
Next time they try to put
a plate back, I'll kill them!

63
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:25,650
Gah!

64
00:05:25,650 --> 00:05:26,980
Did you get a phone call?

65
00:05:26,980 --> 00:05:28,420
It's my little sister!

66
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:30,860
I need to step out. Stay right here!

67
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:36,830
I can't help it! I suddenly got
a really important mission.

68
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:39,900
I promise I'll take you
shopping some other time.

69
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:42,200
Huh? Where am I right now?

70
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:43,510
Mouse Sushi.

71
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:45,640
You've got it all wrong!

72
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:47,460
This is seriously a mission!

73
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:49,250
Hey, come on. Don't cry.

74
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:51,170
I'll explain everything later.

75
00:05:51,170 --> 00:05:54,030
I-I'm hanging up now. Later.

76
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:58,350
I'm the one who wants to cry.

77
00:05:58,350 --> 00:06:01,350
I'm never taking requests
from executives ever again.

78
00:06:02,890 --> 00:06:04,710
Shit! Is that Garo?

79
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,560
Papa!

80
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,920
Apparently not.

81
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:13,070
Save him! That monster's got my son!

82
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:16,150
He's definitely an executive
from the Hero Association.

83
00:06:16,150 --> 00:06:20,200
How nice of him to bring
his kid. Let's take him.

84
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,720
Hang on, damn it.

85
00:06:24,010 --> 00:06:27,030
I'm not letting you set
foot outside this place.

86
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:32,210
You haven't paid yet.

87
00:06:33,250 --> 00:06:36,890
Charanko said he entered on a whim.

88
00:06:37,890 --> 00:06:41,270
What a moron. But...

89
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:45,390
I wouldn't be surprised if someone
strong was actually here.

90
00:06:46,150 --> 00:06:48,160
May I have your name, sir?

91
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:50,860
Uh... Charanko.

92
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:53,570
Please write down your fighting style.

93
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,150
Fighting style?

94
00:06:55,150 --> 00:06:58,830
I think it was, uh...

95
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:04,050
So this is the lineup for this tournament...

96
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:09,670
It's seeded. I wonder if this
Bakuzan guy is strong, then.

97
00:07:09,670 --> 00:07:13,840
Or if we go the other way,
I guess this Suiryu guy is the seed.

98
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:18,050
Hey, you're Charanko, right?

99
00:07:18,050 --> 00:07:19,930
Shit. Does he actually know Charanko?

100
00:07:19,930 --> 00:07:24,480
Hey, come on, now.
Did you forget the face of your senpai?

101
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:28,100
Is "Fist of Water Polo, Carbonation"
supposed to be some kind of joke?

102
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:30,860
Well, I can't blame you for panicking.

103
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:34,340
You never did like me.

104
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:42,450
He better not have entered the
tournament in my place...

105
00:07:43,590 --> 00:07:45,490
I guess he's not that stupid.

106
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,320
No, wait. Saitama does seem pretty stupid.

107
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,290
Saitama?

108
00:07:51,050 --> 00:07:53,130
Oh, you're...

109
00:07:53,130 --> 00:07:56,340
You know Saitama?

110
00:07:57,220 --> 00:08:01,550
Charanko, do you know why
I entered this tournament?

111
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:05,270
I couldn't care less, to be honest.
Could you please just go away?

112
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:07,180
There are two reasons.

113
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:09,770
First, because this Super Fight tournament

114
00:08:09,770 --> 00:08:13,100
is one of the best ways for a fighter
to make a name for themselves.

115
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:16,190
Master Bang won a while back.

116
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:18,230
And the second reason...

117
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:20,490
The incident that happened
at last year's tournament.

118
00:08:21,170 --> 00:08:24,790
The winner was a masked
fighter named Wolfman.

119
00:08:24,790 --> 00:08:30,510
But later on, they found the
actual Wolfman unconscious.

120
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:36,760
And that's why they banned entering under
false names and the use of disguises.

121
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:39,260
D-Disguises?

122
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:44,260
You putting down a false fighting
style might also be in the gray area.

123
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,520
What happens if they find out?

124
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:49,230
You're stripped your qualifications
and permanently banned.

125
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,310
And considering last year's incident,

126
00:08:51,310 --> 00:08:54,230
you'll probably also be sued
and slapped with a huge fine.

127
00:08:54,230 --> 00:08:56,690
You might even be arrested.

128
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,140
Huh? What?!

129
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:00,530
Huh? What's up?

130
00:09:01,030 --> 00:09:04,150
Don't tell me you...

131
00:09:05,650 --> 00:09:08,160
have an idea who that
despicable impostor was!

132
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,570
I'm safe.

133
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:13,210
After seeing the video of them fighting,
I'm certain I know who it is.

134
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:14,770
There's no doubt about it.

135
00:09:15,190 --> 00:09:16,920
The impostor in the last tournament

136
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,880
was Garo!

137
00:09:19,540 --> 00:09:21,510
Heya. I'm back again.

138
00:09:22,470 --> 00:09:25,100
Oh, hey, old dude!
Are you out patrolling again?

139
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:29,180
Stop calling me "old dude."
And let me borrow that book.

140
00:09:29,180 --> 00:09:30,890
I told you, you can't borrow it.

141
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:32,000
Huh?

142
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,560
I'm saying... that we
should read it together.

143
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,370
Garo, huh?

144
00:09:41,370 --> 00:09:43,410
That name came up again.

145
00:09:43,410 --> 00:09:45,350
About six months ago.

146
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:48,500
So it's right after the incident
where he was expelled by our master.

147
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:49,620
There's no doubt about it.

148
00:09:49,970 --> 00:09:51,200
That incident?

149
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:54,430
You were off slacking somewhere,
so I'm sure you didn't know,

150
00:09:54,430 --> 00:09:58,170
but it happened while the master was gone.

151
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,660
I'm tired of this.

152
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:04,380
Huh?

153
00:10:04,780 --> 00:10:08,050
There's nothing else I can learn here.

154
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,080
Let's have an actual fight.

155
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:15,150
He was hiding his true intent
while sharpening his fangs.

156
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:21,280
If he hadn't shown up, we wouldn't
have had to leave the dojo, damn it!

157
00:10:21,590 --> 00:10:24,700
That's why I'm going to win
this tournament today

158
00:10:25,990 --> 00:10:28,200
and regain my confidence.

159
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:32,080
Confidence that I can get to Garo's level.

160
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:37,120
But to think that you'd have the
guts to enter the Super Fight when

161
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,180
you were one of the weakest at the dojo...

162
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:40,840
You sure got cocky.

163
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,220
I hear you're calling yourself
Master Bang's top student,

164
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,180
but don't get too full of yourself.

165
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:52,360
I see. So Saitama might enter
the tournament in your place.

166
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,810
Yeah.

167
00:10:53,810 --> 00:10:56,800
If someone inexperienced ends up
entering a tournament like that...

168
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,460
They'll definitely be killed.

169
00:10:58,460 --> 00:10:59,620
You don't need to worry.

170
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:01,780
After all, he's...

171
00:11:03,050 --> 00:11:04,740
a hero.

172
00:11:05,310 --> 00:11:09,030
You know, I wouldn't have
left the dojo if I'd known

173
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:11,170
that Garo was going to be expelled.

174
00:11:11,170 --> 00:11:12,540
But if I hadn't quit,

175
00:11:12,540 --> 00:11:17,050
I, Sourface, would've been Master
Bang's number one student right now.

176
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:22,090
How about it? Why don't we practice
some holds until you pass out again?

177
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:25,550
But you did quit the dojo, right?

178
00:11:25,550 --> 00:11:26,680
What?

179
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:29,760
Charanko fought Garo one-on-one.

180
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:33,220
But anyway, I plan on defeating Garo myself.

181
00:11:33,590 --> 00:11:37,190
As long as he's hunting heroes, I'm sure
I'll run into him sooner or later.

182
00:11:37,190 --> 00:11:38,680
What I'm saying is that

183
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:42,090
you ran away, so you don't get to
act like you're better than me.

184
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:46,820
You'd better be prepared
to defend those words!

185
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:49,900
The Super Fight is a one-day tournament.

186
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:52,830
If you can actually manage
to win your way to the top,

187
00:11:52,830 --> 00:11:54,890
we're going to bump heads in the ring.

188
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:58,750
And that's when I'll show you

189
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:02,380
what a real battle is.

190
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:08,430
A real battle, huh?

191
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:14,640
I don't remember what
that feels like at all.

192
00:12:20,270 --> 00:12:21,770
That was amazing, Papa!

193
00:12:21,770 --> 00:12:23,770
He defeated them in no time!

194
00:12:23,770 --> 00:12:25,860
All right, let's take a
picture to remember this.

195
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:29,570
Hey, hurry up and take cover. It's dangerous.

196
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:33,580
Venus-People Trap and I were
both annihilated instantly.

197
00:12:33,890 --> 00:12:37,040
Considering what you did to us,
I guess you really are strong,

198
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,800
Metal Bat.

199
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:41,710
So that's what a Class S hero is like, huh?

200
00:12:42,090 --> 00:12:47,930
But if you're that strong,
you probably think you're the strongest.

201
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:51,620
I was the same way...

202
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:53,350
Man, bugs are persistent.

203
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:55,560
I should probably finish you off.

204
00:12:55,560 --> 00:13:00,980
But then, my senpai showed up...

205
00:13:11,170 --> 00:13:12,070
Another one?!

206
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:17,310
Kohai, I'll avenge you.

207
00:13:20,540 --> 00:13:22,670
It's so creepy!

208
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,710
That thing's twice the
size of the other one!

209
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:30,040
What's that smell?

210
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:47,770
So the hero hunter Garo has
nothing to do with this?

211
00:13:47,770 --> 00:13:50,490
Well, thinking about that's
not gonna help right now.

212
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:55,560
I'm just going to crush you!

213
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:59,890
Yup! He'll get back up and face
the enemy, no matter what!

214
00:13:59,890 --> 00:14:03,120
So you don't have to worry about Saitama!

215
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,470
U-Uh, I—

216
00:14:04,470 --> 00:14:08,470
Besides, he would never break
the rules to enter in your place.

217
00:14:08,470 --> 00:14:09,730
He's a hero, after all!

218
00:14:09,730 --> 00:14:10,960
R-Right...

219
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:14,180
That's good, I guess...

220
00:14:14,820 --> 00:14:15,770
Yeah!

221
00:14:20,910 --> 00:14:21,850
Man...

222
00:14:22,830 --> 00:14:24,480
I'm bored.

223
00:14:26,580 --> 00:14:28,190
This is Watchdog Man.

224
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:29,650
Isn't he cute?

225
00:14:30,570 --> 00:14:33,110
He just looks like some
guy in a dog costume.

226
00:14:33,890 --> 00:14:35,320
Is he actually strong?

227
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:38,030
Of course he is! He's a Class S hero!

228
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:40,740
Class S Rank 12, huh?

229
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:45,230
He usually sits atop his
own special lookout.

230
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:47,910
You can meet him there at any time!

231
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:49,150
Oh?

232
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:54,340
Urgent evacuation order.
Urgent evacuation order.

233
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:58,100
Monsters have appeared in the
shopping district of City S.

234
00:14:58,100 --> 00:14:59,600
Threat level: Demon.

235
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:04,560
Currently, Class S hero
Metal Bat is on the scene.

236
00:15:05,170 --> 00:15:09,020
Everyone outside should
immediately seek shelter indoors.

237
00:15:09,020 --> 00:15:09,810
Old dude...

238
00:15:09,810 --> 00:15:11,560
Well, you heard her.

239
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:14,140
Hurry up and run home.

240
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:15,030
Okay!

241
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,760
I repeat.

242
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:21,240
Urgent evacuation order.
Urgent evacuation order.

243
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,880
Centipede Parade!

244
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,520
Not bad.

245
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,020
No wonder he gave our kohai trouble.

246
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:53,480
What the hell do you guys want?

247
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:55,690
Why are you after them?

248
00:15:58,020 --> 00:16:01,160
We'll tell you if you can defeat us.

249
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:07,460
Looks like my sleep smell is finally kicking in.

250
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:08,790
Perfect!

251
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:17,050
I'm losing consciousness...

252
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:27,340
Now, goodnight!

253
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,890
Take that, and that, and that!

254
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:38,820
He just... hit himself in the head?

255
00:16:42,330 --> 00:16:44,120
Did you finally lose your mind?!

256
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:52,330
Man, I feel so much better.

257
00:16:52,980 --> 00:16:55,380
He's even more powerful than before!

258
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:59,050
But my sleep smell shouldn't
wear off that easily...

259
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:01,850
What in the world happened?!

260
00:17:01,850 --> 00:17:05,460
If I can pump myself up, I can
pretty much handle anything.

261
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:10,100
You guys beat me pretty damn hard earlier.

262
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:14,480
But you see, I'm a pretty nice guy...

263
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:16,630
So I'll wipe you both out

264
00:17:16,630 --> 00:17:19,030
with a single blow!

265
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:32,580
I haven't been that pumped in a while.

266
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:39,520
I forgot to ask the monsters
what their motive was!

267
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,280
It totally slipped my mind.

268
00:17:42,930 --> 00:17:45,050
Looks like they're unharmed.

269
00:17:45,050 --> 00:17:49,060
Hey, wake up, you jerks.
Or should I smack you awake?

270
00:17:50,370 --> 00:17:51,430
We came to back you up!

271
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,840
We'll fight, too!

272
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:57,270
Oh, I just finished up.

273
00:17:57,270 --> 00:17:57,900
Huh?

274
00:17:57,900 --> 00:17:59,400
What?!

275
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:03,460
Well, Metal Bat never ceases to amaze me.

276
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:06,370
Now that family should be...

277
00:18:06,930 --> 00:18:07,900
What's the matter?

278
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:12,800
The fact that Centikohai and Centisenpai
appeared one after another

279
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,070
probably means...

280
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:15,250
Hey, you don't mean...

281
00:18:15,250 --> 00:18:17,900
You remember the incident from
two years ago, don't you?

282
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:20,180
If that thing appears again...

283
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:23,050
Yeah. It won't be a matter
of bodyguards anymore.

284
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:26,550
The city will be destroyed.

285
00:18:31,390 --> 00:18:32,850
Th-That's...

286
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,040
The great monster, Centichoro!

287
00:18:37,930 --> 00:18:40,360
It's threat level is... Dragon!

288
00:18:40,770 --> 00:18:41,610
Dragon, eh?

289
00:18:41,990 --> 00:18:45,850
I'll go call for Class S backup.
Let's get out of here for now.

290
00:18:45,850 --> 00:18:48,070
That thing's after that family there.

291
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,990
You guys take them while
I deal with this guy.

292
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,330
As fast as you can!

293
00:18:53,330 --> 00:18:54,540
Hurry!

294
00:18:54,540 --> 00:18:58,000
Now, then... What to do?

295
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:01,460
Is that thing staring at us?

296
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,180
You won't get away.

297
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:07,550
It's charging!

298
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:11,850
Don't turn around! Just keep running!

299
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:20,360
It's so hard!

300
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:22,400
Out of my way!

301
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:32,760
My full swing didn't even
make a crack in that thing.

302
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,330
But...

303
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:37,420
That bastard made sure I didn't
hit its face with the bat.

304
00:19:38,330 --> 00:19:40,040
So that's exactly where I'm gonna aim!

305
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:51,970
It's coming after us!

306
00:19:52,410 --> 00:19:54,770
No, wait. Look above it!

307
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:56,330
That's—

308
00:19:57,450 --> 00:19:58,480
Killer Move...

309
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:00,980
Pumped-Up...

310
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:02,920
Dragon Pummelin'!

311
00:20:11,950 --> 00:20:14,330
Centipede Undulation!

312
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:20,390
This is what a Dragon-level monster is like?

313
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:23,920
Humanity shouldn't have to
face something like that!

314
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:27,730
Urgent evacuation order.

315
00:20:27,730 --> 00:20:33,680
Another Dragon-level monster
has appeared in City S.

316
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,260
Did the heroes lose?!

317
00:20:37,260 --> 00:20:39,440
This world is finished!

318
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,900
Run! Hurry!

319
00:20:41,230 --> 00:20:43,860
Wow, things sure got lively.

320
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:47,900
I guess that would happen when
a Dragon-level monster appears.

321
00:20:48,610 --> 00:20:52,990
Now, I wonder if I'll find Metal Bat alive...

322
00:20:57,090 --> 00:20:58,370
Metal Bat?

323
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:00,110
How?

324
00:21:00,710 --> 00:21:03,230
Oh, I see.

325
00:21:03,230 --> 00:21:07,250
To think that a Class S hero was done
in by any other monster but me...

326
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:08,440
Damn. I wasted my time.

327
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:11,090
Man... I need to hurry up and get back.

328
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:16,060
H-Hey, wait a sec, Metal Bat!

329
00:21:16,470 --> 00:21:18,680
If you're alive, that's a different story!

330
00:21:20,870 --> 00:21:22,900
Sweet. My second Class S hero!

331
00:21:23,230 --> 00:21:26,330
Now you have to fight me.
I'm gonna hunt you!

332
00:21:26,330 --> 00:21:28,360
Huh? What the hell are you
talking about, you moron?

333
00:21:28,760 --> 00:21:30,640
Don't you see that giant centipede?

334
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,780
Hurry up and evac—

335
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:38,160
I see.

336
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:42,170
So you're the human calling yourself
the hero-hunting monster...

337
00:21:42,490 --> 00:21:45,130
That's right. I'm Garo.

338
00:21:47,090 --> 00:21:49,480
I'm busy, damn it.

339
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:54,560
If you're picking a fight with me,
I'm gonna bash your crazy head in.

340
00:23:26,910 --> 00:23:29,900
What? There's a Dragon-level monster in City S!

341
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:31,400
You're right. That sounds bad.

342
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:34,650
You girls are going to watch
the Super Fight, right?

343
00:23:35,030 --> 00:23:36,760
Take me with you.

344
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:38,910
I haven't been there in ages,
so I don't remember the way.

345
00:23:38,910 --> 00:23:40,480
Y-You're...

346
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,410
Aren't you...

347
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:43,720
You don't mind, right?
